   {
    "id": "p_00012",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     13
    ],
    "text": "For all other file types defined in this volume of POSIX.1-2024, the structure members [I39]st_mode[/I39], [I40]st_ino[/I40],\n[I41]st_dev[/I41], [I42]st_uid[/I42], [I43]st_gid[/I43], [I44]st_atim[/I44], [I45]st_ctim[/I45], and [I46]st_mtim[/I46] shall have meaningful values and\nthe value of the member [I47]st_nlink[/I47] shall be set to the number of hard links to the file.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I39": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I40": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I41": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I42": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I43": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I44": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I45": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I46": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I47": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00013",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     15
    ],
    "text": "The [I48]lstat[/I48]() function shall be equivalent to [I49]stat[/I49](), except when [I50]path[/I50] refers to a symbolic link. In that\ncase [I51]lstat[/I51]() shall return information about the link, while [I52]stat[/I52]() shall return information about the file the link\nreferences.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I48": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I49": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I50": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I51": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I52": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00014",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     17
    ],
    "text": "For symbolic links, the [I53]st_mode[/I53] member shall contain meaningful information when used with the file type macros. The file\nmode bits in [I54]st_mode[/I54] are unspecified. The structure members [I55]st_ino[/I55], [I56]st_dev[/I56], [I57]st_uid[/I57], [I58]st_gid[/I58],\n[I59]st_atim[/I59], [I60]st_ctim[/I60], and [I61]st_mtim[/I61] shall have meaningful values and the value of the [I62]st_nlink[/I62] member shall\nbe set to the number of hard links to the symbolic link. The value of the [I63]st_size[/I63] member shall be set to the length of the\npathname contained in the symbolic link not including any terminating null byte.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I53": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I54": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I55": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I56": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I57": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I58": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I59": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I60": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I61": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I62": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I63": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00015",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     19
    ],
    "text": "The [I64]fstatat[/I64]() function shall be equivalent to the [I65]stat[/I65]() or [I66]lstat[/I66]() function, depending on the value of\n[I67]flag[/I67] (see below), except in the case where [I68]path[/I68] specifies a relative path. In this case the status shall be retrieved\nfrom a file relative to the directory associated with the file descriptor [I69]fd[/I69] instead of the current working directory. If\nthe access mode of the open file description associated with the file descriptor is not O_SEARCH, the function shall check whether\ndirectory searches are permitted using the current permissions of the directory underlying the file descriptor. If the access mode\nis O_SEARCH, the function shall not perform the check.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I64": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I65": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I66": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I67": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I68": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I69": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00016",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     21
    ],
    "text": "Values for [I70]flag[/I70] are constructed by a bitwise-inclusive OR of flags from the following list, defined in [A71][I72]&lt;fcntl.h&gt;[/I72][/A71]:",
    "placeholders": {
     "I70": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A71": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../basedefs/fcntl.h.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I72": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00017",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     23,
     3
    ],
    "text": "AT_SYMLINK_NOFOLLOW",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00018",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     23,
     5
    ],
    "text": "If [I73]path[/I73] names a symbolic link, the status of the symbolic link is returned.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I73": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00019",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     25
    ],
    "text": "If [I74]fstatat[/I74]() is passed the special value AT_FDCWD in the [I75]fd[/I75] parameter, the current working directory shall be used\nand the behavior shall be identical to a call to [I76]stat[/I76]() or [I77]lstat[/I77]() respectively, depending on whether or not the\nAT_SYMLINK_NOFOLLOW bit is set in [I78]flag[/I78].",
    "placeholders": {
     "I74": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I75": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I76": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I77": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I78": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00020",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     23
    ],
    "text": "[A79][/A79]RETURN VALUE",
    "placeholders": {
